Suggests:
 helios
Description: NorviOS desktop components and apps for Ubuntu
 Installs the NorviOS desktop for GNOME 50 on Ubuntu 26.04 from the NorviTech
 APT repository: the dock, the workspace bar, the transparent top bar, rounded
 blur, the power-only system menu, the lock screen and wallpaper extensions,
 XNote sticky notes with their placement extension, SnipSnap screenshots and
 the Timecrate backup app.
 .
 The components are recommended rather than required, so any one of them can
 be removed without removing this package, and no version is pinned: each
 component updates on its own. It depends on norvi-archive-keyring, which
 keeps the repository source and its signing key current.
 .
 The boot and login styling and the per-user glass theme can be applied
 from the NorviOS source using the instructions on the homepage.

Package: norvi-window-glass
Architecture: amd64
Section: gnome
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, gnome-shell, python3
Recommends: gnome-rounded-blur (>= 2.0.0)
Description: Live window glass for the NorviOS desktop
 Provides Blur my Shell v76 with a cached renderer for application windows.
 Updates outside a window's glass can reuse its backdrop. Custom materials
 continue to use their selected effects. A matched Ubuntu Wayland session
 can use damage bounds from a private pair of compositor libraries. Ubuntu
 retains ownership of its system compositor and can update it independently.
